<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dermatology Study System Design</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        /* Inter font - Tailwind typically handles this, but as a fallback or explicit choice */
        body { 
            font-family: 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji";
        }
        .component-box { 
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out; 
        }
        .component-box:hover { 
            transform: translateY(-2px); 
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); 
        }
        /* Custom scrollbar for better aesthetics if content overflows, optional */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f1f1;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #cbd5e1; /* tailwind gray-400 */
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #94a3b8; /* tailwind gray-500 */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 p-4 md:p-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-white shadow-2xl rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
        <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 p-6 md:p-8 text-white">
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center">Dermatology Study System Design</h1>
            <p class="text-center text-blue-200 mt-2 text-sm md:text-base">A Comprehensive Multi-Agent System for Learning & Exam Preparation</p>
        </header>

        <main class="p-6 md:p-8 space-y-10">
            <section class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg shadow-md component-box">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-indigo-700 mb-4 border-b-2 border-indigo-200 pb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 inline-block mr-2 -mt-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
                    User & External Actors
                </h2>
                <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-3">
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-purple-600 font-semibold w-48 shrink-0">End User:</span> <span class="text-slate-700">Interacts with the UI for all learning activities, quizzes, chat, simulations, etc.</span></li>
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-purple-600 font-semibold w-48 shrink-0">SMEs / Developers:</span> <span class="text-slate-700">Curate knowledge base content, review AI-generated questions and feedback, maintain and enhance the system.</span></li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg shadow-md component-box">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-indigo-700 mb-4 border-b-2 border-indigo-200 pb-2">
                     <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 inline-block mr-2 -mt-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.37 3.414-1.414 3.414H4.828c-1.784 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" /></svg>
                    Core Infrastructure
                </h2>
                <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-3">
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-teal-600 font-semibold w-48 shrink-0">User Interface (UI):</span> <span class="text-slate-700">Web or mobile application providing the user experience.</span></li>
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-teal-600 font-semibold w-48 shrink-0">Backend Server / API Gateway:</span> <span class="text-slate-700">Manages requests, authentication, and routes traffic to appropriate backend services.</span></li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg shadow-md component-box">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-indigo-700 mb-4 border-b-2 border-indigo-200 pb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 inline-block mr-2 -mt-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01" /></svg>
                    Backend Services & Agents
                </h2>
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-blue-700">Knowledge Base Agent (KBA)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Manages and provides access to vetted clinical reference materials using vector search for RAG.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-blue-700">Quiz Generation (QG-MAS)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Multi-agent system (TSA, QSGA, CAGA, DGA, EGA with ELI5, QARA) for creating MCQs.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-blue-700">User Performance Tracker (UPTA)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Monitors, analyzes, and stores user performance data across all learning activities.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-blue-700">Feedback Processing Agent (FPA)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Collects, categorizes, and analyzes user feedback on content and system functionality.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-blue-700">Chat Agent (CA)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Powers RAG-based conversational Q&A; includes ELI5 and DDx support.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-green-700">Differential Diagnosis Tool (DDxAgent)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Assists in exploring differential diagnoses based on clinical findings and KBA data.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-green-700">Clinical Case Simulator (CCS)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Multi-agent system (CSA, UIQA, CPOA, LFA) for interactive clinical case scenarios.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-green-700">Personalized Study Planner (PSPAgent)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Creates tailored study plans based on user goals, performance, and SRS data.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-green-700">Flashcard Tool (FGT)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Enables creation, management, and study of digital flashcards; integrated with SRS.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-green-700">Spaced Repetition System (SRSModule)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Optimizes learning by scheduling reviews of questions and flashcards.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
                        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg text-green-700">Gamification Engine (GEModule)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Integrates points, badges, and leaderboards to enhance user engagement.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg shadow-md component-box">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-indigo-700 mb-4 border-b-2 border-indigo-200 pb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 inline-block mr-2 -mt-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4M4 7 M12 11v10M12 21c-4.418 0-8-1.79-8-4" /></svg>
                    Knowledge Base & Data Stores
                </h2>
                <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-3">
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-orange-600 font-semibold w-48 shrink-0">Vector Database:</span> <span class="text-slate-700">Stores embeddings of clinical reference materials for efficient KBA retrieval.</span></li>
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-orange-600 font-semibold w-48 shrink-0">Relational/NoSQL DBs:</span> <span class="text-slate-700">Store user data, quiz questions, performance metrics, feedback, chat logs, study plans, flashcards, gamification states, and other application data.</span></li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg shadow-md component-box">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-indigo-700 mb-4 border-b-2 border-indigo-200 pb-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 inline-block mr-2 -mt-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" /></svg>
                    Key Interactions & Flows
                </h2>
                <div class="space-y-3 text-slate-700 text-sm">
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">UI <-> Backend:</strong> Primary communication channel for all user actions and data display.</p>
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">Backend <-> Agents/Modules:</strong> Orchestrates calls to specialized backend components.</p>
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">KBA as Central Knowledge Source:</strong> QG-MAS, CA, DDxAgent, CCS, PSPAgent, FGT query KBA for RAG.</p>
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">Data Persistence:</strong> All relevant agents/modules (UPTA, FPA, QG-MAS, CA, etc.) interact with Databases for storing and retrieving persistent data.</p>
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">UPTA Data Distribution:</strong> Feeds performance data to SRSModule, PSPAgent, GEModule, TSA (QG-MAS), and FGT.</p>
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">Learning Loop (SRS, PSP, UPTA):</strong> UPTA tracks performance, SRS schedules reviews, PSP adapts study plans, creating a personalized learning cycle.</p>
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">SME/Developer Feedback Loop:</strong> FPA provides feedback to SMEs; SMEs update KBA, review QARA flags, and guide system evolution.</p>
                    <p><strong class="text-sky-600">Integrated Tools:</strong> CA supports ELI5 and can transition to DDxAgent. EGA (in QG-MAS) also provides ELI5.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer class="text-center py-6 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">&copy; Dermatology Study System - Conceptual Design Document</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
